#Протокол_WorkGraph_Daemon_Scheduler_Tick<[
Базис:
  Agent worker live-loop доказал claim/run/evidence/proposal для одной задачи, но WorkGraph OS нужен scheduler-owned tick вместо ручного CLI или chat-owned execution.
  Daemon не владеет canonical Work Graph state: он читает snapshot, выбирает eligible projection, вызывает worker adapter и пишет audit/recovery metadata.
Вектор:
  Один tick = observe snapshot -> schedule eligible task -> run one bounded worker/live-loop -> recovery suggestion -> audit tick result -> stop.
  Tick input: schema workgraph.daemon.tick.input.v1, backlogPath, optional taskId, schedulerPolicy (paused, maxRunsPerTick=1), workerInput policy, runId prefix.
  Tick output: schema workgraph.daemon.tick.output.v1, tickId, selectedTaskId, workerRunSummary, auditRecord, recoverySuggestion, finalItems projection (backlog persist — через POST /api/agent-run / implement-agent-run-backlog-persist; daemon tick пока projection-only).
  Audit journal: append-only work/daemon-audit.jsonl with tickId, phases, taskId, worker status, recovery class, recordedAt.
  Live-loop link: tick run phase delegates to runAgentWorkerLiveLoop; daemon adds scheduling gate and audit wrapper, not duplicate worker logic.
Цель:
  Operator и future background daemon имеют один documented tick contract между Work Graph snapshot и worker execution.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: workgraph-daemon-scheduler-tick
  work.source: design-workgraph-daemon-scheduler-tick
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Контракт_Tick_Input_V1<[
Базис:
  Scheduler must rebuild from observable Work Graph state on every tick.
Вектор:
  Fields: schema, tickId, backlogPath, taskId?, schedulerPolicy { paused, dryRun }, workerInput options, journalPaths { audit, workerRuns }.
  paused=true: tick returns skipped without claiming; dryRun=true: schedule selection only, no worker run.
Цель:
  Tick can be invoked safely from CLI --once, tests and future watch loop with the same shape.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: workgraph-daemon-tick-input-v1
  protocol.id: workgraph-daemon-scheduler-tick
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Контракт_Tick_Output_V1<[
Базис:
  Tick result must be auditable without provider session replay.
Вектор:
  Fields: schema, ok, tickId, phases[], selectedTaskId, skippedReason?, workerOutput?, workerRunSummary?, auditRecord, recoverySuggestion?, error?.
  auditRecord: { tickId, taskId, workerStatus, recoveryClass, recordedAt, phaseSummary }.
  recoverySuggestion: { preset, action, reason, retryAdvice } from workgraph-recovery-policy-presets.
Цель:
  Dashboard and operator review can show last tick outcome from audit journal alone.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: workgraph-daemon-tick-output-v1
  protocol.id: workgraph-daemon-scheduler-tick
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Audit_Events<[
Базис:
  Audit journal is derived projection, not canonical task state.
Вектор:
  Event types: tick_started, task_scheduled, worker_run_finished, tick_skipped, tick_failed, recovery_suggested.
  Each line is JSON with tickId, event, taskId?, summary, recordedAt; stored in work/daemon-audit.jsonl alongside work/worker-runs.jsonl.
  UI/dashboard may read recent audit lines via dashboard snapshot extension in a later task; MVP uses file journal only.
Цель:
  Scheduler behavior is reconstructable after crash or manual operator intervention.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: workgraph-daemon-audit-events-v1
  protocol.id: workgraph-daemon-scheduler-tick
  trace.status: verified
]>
